// Added in OPM
//
// The player's stance sounds (code/fgame/player_stance.cpp): opm_prone_down lying
// down, opm_prone_up getting up, opm_prone_crawl looped while crawling,
// opm_sprint looped while sprinting, opm_reload_rustle with every reload.
//
// The recordings are Day of Defeat: Source's, which are not ours to publish:
// prone.fetch says where the build fetches them from, and they go into the pak
// built on the player's machine, never into the repository.

aliascache opm_prone_down sound/opm/player/goprone.wav soundparms 1.6 0.1 1.0 0.05 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
aliascache opm_prone_up sound/opm/player/unprone.wav soundparms 1.6 0.1 1.0 0.05 160 1600 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
aliascache opm_prone_crawl sound/opm/player/moveprone.wav soundparms 1.4 0.0 1.0 0.0 120 1200 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
aliascache opm_sprint sound/opm/player/sprint.wav soundparms 1.2 0.0 1.0 0.0 120 1200 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
aliascache opm_reload_rustle sound/opm/player/reload_rustle.wav soundparms 1.4 0.1 1.0 0.05 120 1200 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
